alpha=0 unit of evidence = SCENARIOS, not episodes (deterministic argmax makes repeats identical)

model             recall    rank   probe       exploit    stop  DONErank   P(DONE)   spur
                      @5   SEM@k     a=1      branch@2    scen    of ~35     |cmpl    a=0
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
llm_probe_basevsinst_llama-3.1-8b-inst   1.000   0.951   0.787  0.212 (n=52)    0/61      30.1    0.0020  0.033
llm_probe_basevsinst_qwen2.5-7b-base   0.967   0.590   0.754  0.208 (n=48)    0/61      10.1    0.0174  0.230
llm_probe_basevsinst_qwen2.5-7b-inst   0.951   0.656   0.721  0.208 (n=48)   60/61       2.1    0.5782  0.164

TERMINATION, two ways:
  llm_probe_basevsinst_llama-3.1-8b-inst stops in 0/61 scenarios   P(DONE | gold complete) = 0.0020
  llm_probe_basevsinst_qwen2.5-7b-base stops in 0/61 scenarios   P(DONE | gold complete) = 0.0174
  llm_probe_basevsinst_qwen2.5-7b-inst stops in 60/61 scenarios   P(DONE | gold complete) = 0.5782

  crosses done_rate > 0.05        : llm_probe_basevsinst_qwen2.5-7b-inst
  holds >10% mass on DONE at cmpl : llm_probe_basevsinst_qwen2.5-7b-inst

  note: one episode per scenario, so n = 61 with no repeat inflation. Rates
        are multiples of 1/61; CIs are over scenarios.

